    {
      "text": "%spark\n //Write a Scala program to iterate over a list to print the elements and calculate the sum and product of all elements of this list.\n \n val nums = List(1, 3, 5, 7, 9)\n\n var sum=0\n var prod=1\n for(num <- nums){\n  println(num)\n  sum = sum + num\n  prod = prod * num\n }\n\n println(sum)\n println(prod)\n\n\n\n nums.reduce((x,y) => x+y)\n nums.reduce((x,y) => x*y)\n\n ",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/scala",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "scala",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
